"""The task: one action, ``extract``.

The commission names the kind of experiment (``experiment_type``, a controlled value: 'spr', 'itc', 'bli', 'gci', 'fp', 'fret', 'mst', 'trp_quenching', 'fcs', 'elisa', 'alphascreen', 'radioligand', 'spa', 'pulldown', 'emsa', 'sec', 'dialysis' or 'auc'). Code picks, by
that value, the extraction module (``FORMS``) and, through the record's own type, the grader; the model never picks
either and never calls the grader.

The model is asked once per unit, with the chunk, to fill the answer form derived from that kind's grader input form
(``literature_spr_extraction``, ``literature_itc_extraction``, ``literature_bli_extraction``, ``literature_gci_extraction``, ``literature_fp_extraction``, ``literature_fret_extraction``, ``literature_mst_extraction``, ``literature_trp_extraction``, ``literature_fcs_extraction``, ``literature_elisa_extraction``, ``literature_alpha_extraction``, ``literature_radioligand_extraction``, ``literature_spa_extraction``, ``literature_pulldown_extraction``, ``literature_emsa_extraction``, ``literature_sec_extraction``, ``literature_dialysis_extraction`` or ``literature_auc_extraction``). ``action`` checks the answer with that module's
validator (an answer that is not in the form, or a quote that is not in the chunk exactly once, is rejected before
any unit exists and ``decide`` asks again with the reason). The unit, ``extract``, turns the valid answer into the
record of that kind and holds it through the custody-scoped store; the leaf's output is that immutable record (its ref) and
nothing else. Grading and judging belong to the page's update. There is no model call after the extraction."""
